pt;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; : </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.7pt; font-size: 11pt;\">경북창조경제혁신센터에서 주관하는 경북지역 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.7pt; font-size: 11pt;\">22</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.7pt; font-size: 11pt;\">개 대학교 통합 경진대회인</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">회 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">G-Star </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">대학생 창업경진대회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">\" </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">본선에 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">금오공과대학교 대표로 반드시 출전해야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" styl