=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">동상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(5</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">) : </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">11</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">창업동아리 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">시제품 제작비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">만원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">)  </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">별도 지원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">창업동아리 구성 및 활동을 해야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">예정</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">대 회 명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">2020 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">창업</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">․</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">발명 아이디어 경진대회</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">공모주제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">창의성 있는 창업 및 발명 아이디어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">기술개발품 및 지식서비스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">참가대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">재학생으로 구성된 개인 또는 팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">대학원생 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">일    정</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;  1) </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">신청접수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: <span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b>8. 7.(</b></span></span><b><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">), 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">까지</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;  2) </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">서류심사 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:<span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 8. 10.(</span></b></span></span><b><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">) ~ 12.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;  3) </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">발표심사 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: <span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b>8. 13.(</b></span></span><b><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">오전 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">10:00~</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;      </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">일정은 추후 사정에 의해 변경될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">접수방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">붙임파일의 신청서를 작성한 후 </span><u><s